{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20267M4p0sTEMX1792902721.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>處境劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》日前（22日）播出的最新一集中，除了高冠一（容天佑 飾）向朱圓圓（何依婷 飾）的浪漫告白情節外，何依婷更迎來突破性的爆笑演出。</p><p></p><p>劇中講述何依婷在女廁內，與自己幻想出來的「嬤嬤」展開對話，並以一身亮眼的清朝古裝造型登場。何依婷坦言，自己此前從未試過穿著清朝服飾，因此對這次的古裝造型感到非常新鮮和有趣。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"e91d67d1-fdd3-4a30-9586-87e68b7c099d.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20267JynO1k5bT1792902721.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"6e26edc6-4ddb-4a2a-aeb2-9ff7b865e676.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026GtUFOvmWr41792902719.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>完成拍攝後，何依婷亦於社交平台分享「舅父」Terry（李偉健 飾）親手繪畫的「嬤嬤」草圖，以及自己先前拍攝的唯美古裝寫真照。相中她清麗脫俗且充滿仙氣，隨即吸引大批網民留言大讚，指她散發出濃厚的古典美人氣息，直呼她宛如「仙女下凡」。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"cfa5c791-376e-47e9-99a0-8e620e773447.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026fhhlFJZE191792902720.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:49.176674+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":280,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T04:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.791778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:13.560090+00:00","content_hash":"a5887700566d082a4163899dcd103aaa989394bb5d02cdb22e9d9f9d9823b22a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:49.176674+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}